  "remarks": "Limited Liability Company “KORD COMPANY” is a shipping company based in Russia. It is the commercial operator of the vessels Kord Wind, Kord Arctic and Kord, as well as the owner of the vessel Kord Atlantic. Those vessels lack adequate liability insurance and engage in manipulation of Automatic Identification Systems while transporting crude oil or petroleum products exported from Russia. Therefore, Limited Liability Company “KORD COMPANY” operates and owns vessels that transport crude oil or petroleum products exported from Russia and practice irregular and high-risk shipping practices as set out in the International Maritime Organization General Assembly resolution A.1192(33).",
